      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Ears_0a1ab58",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: Они всё слышат. Даже когда не надо.",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: Mindent hallanak. Akkor is, amikor nem kellene.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-445.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15091,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941386",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Ears_05e2bf3",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: ...",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15092,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941385",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Ears_0855f12",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: Конечно. Надеюсь, ты не ждёшь чего-то ужасного?",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: Persze. Remélem, nem vársz valami borzalmasat?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-445.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15093,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941384",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_07745a8",
      "source": "Достать ружьё",
      "target": "Puska elővétele",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15094,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941383",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_0d03a89",
      "source": "Отпустить",
      "target": "Elengedés",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-001.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15095,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941382",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_0826268",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: Надеюсь, я выгляжу… достойно. Или хотя бы не слишком жалко.",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: Remélem, méltóságteljesen nézek ki… Vagy legalább nem túl szánalmasan.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-445.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15096,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941381",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_0016119",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: ...",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: ...",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15097,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941380",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_011ce2e",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: Эээй, не надо мне угрожать ружьём! Делай свой снимок. Что тут поделать…",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: Hééé, ne fenyegess a puskáddal! Csináld meg a képet. Mit tehetnék…",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-445.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15098,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941379",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_01a795c",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: …",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: …",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-040.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15099,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941378",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_08456c0",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: Пожалуй, я бы отказался.",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: Inkább nemet mondanék.",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-445.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15100,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941377",
      "collection": "Dialogs",
      "key": "line:Raskolnikov_Photo_0130107",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: Зачем тебе моя фотография?",
      "target": "Raskolnikov: Minek neked a fényképem?",
      "authoredFile": "Translations/hu/dialogue-batch-445.json",
      "reviewResult": "pass"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15101,
      "stableId": "string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452211941376",
