      "context": "Raskolnikov examines his damaged hands and remembers hiding their tremor, hitting the wall and punishing himself for weakness. His words show fear and guilt, not confidence.",
      "source": "Raskolnikov: Но теперь я просто… прячу руки. Вдруг дрожь заметят…",
